@UniversityDecisionHub.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5154

GET {{UniversityDecisionHub.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a sample course

POST https://localhost:7214/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "CourseCode": "CS101",
  "CourseName": "Introduction to Computer Science",
  "DepartmentId": 1,
  "CourseCredit": 3,
  "Ects": 6,
  "RecommendedStudyYear": 1,
  "IsActive": true,
  "IsElective": false,
  "prerequisiteCourseIds": []
}
### Negative credits should be rejected
POST https://localhost:7214/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "TEST-INVALID",
  "courseName": "Invalid Credit Test",
  "courseCredit": -1,
  "ects": 6,
  "recommendedStudyYear": 1,
  "isActive": true,
  "isElective": false,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "prerequisiteCourseIds": []
}

### Get all courses
GET https://localhost:7214/api/courses
Accept: application/json

### Get the existing course
GET https://localhost:7214/api/courses/1
Accept: application/json

### Get a nonexistent course
GET https://localhost:7214/api/courses/999999
Accept: application/json
### Missing recommended year should return 400
POST https://localhost:7214/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "TEST-NO-YEAR",
  "courseName": "Missing year test",
  "departmentId": 1,
  "courseCredit": 3,
  "ects": 6
}

### Zero department should return 400
POST https://localhost:7214/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "TEST-DEPARTMENT",
  "courseName": "Invalid department test",
  "departmentId": 0,
  "recommendedStudyYear": 1,
  "courseCredit": 3,
  "ects": 6
}

### Unsupported filter should return 400 instead of silently ignoring it
GET https://localhost:7214/api/courses?semester=Fall
Accept: application/json

### ---------------- Authentication (synthetic test data only) ----------------

### Register a student
POST http://localhost:5154/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Student",
  "email": "test.student@example.com",
  "password": "synthetic-Pass-1",
  "departmentId": 1,
  "studyYear": 2
}

### Same email in another case should return 409
POST http://localhost:5154/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Student",
  "email": "TEST.Student@Example.com",
  "password": "synthetic-Pass-1",
  "departmentId": 1,
  "studyYear": 2
}

### Log in (copy "token" from the response into @token below)
POST http://localhost:5154/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.student@example.com",
  "password": "synthetic-Pass-1"
}

### Wrong password should return 401
POST http://localhost:5154/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.student@example.com",
  "password": "not-the-password"
}

### Current user profile
@token = paste-token-here
GET http://localhost:5154/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without a token should return 401
GET http://localhost:5154/api/auth/me
